{"id":8097,"date":"2021-10-18T10:05:49","date_gmt":"2021-10-18T14:05:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=8097"},"modified":"2021-10-18T10:05:49","modified_gmt":"2021-10-18T14:05:49","slug":"tourist-review-wyoming-territorial-prison-state-historic-site","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/10\/18\/tourist-review-wyoming-territorial-prison-state-historic-site\/","title":{"rendered":"Tourist Review &#8211; Wyoming Territorial Prison State Historic Site"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>We&#8217;ve been traveling the country for about five years now and we &#8220;workamp&#8221; or volunteer as we go.  We usually work 12-15 hours per person per week in exchange for our RV site and utilities.  Sometimes we get a little extra too, maybe reduced cost at the park store or restaurant, free laundry or some other perk to help out with our monthly living expenses.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We&#8217;ve worked in commercial RV parks, public park campgrounds, museums, and fish hatcheries.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>But we&#8217;ve never worked at a prison!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Our good friends Matt and Sherry had an interesting gig this past spring working (volunteering) at the Wyoming Territorial Prison State Historic Site at Laramie, Wyoming.  They dressed in period costumes and portrayed what it was like to work at (or be incarcerated in) the prison back in &#8220;The Olden Days&#8221;.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"alignright size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/MattSherry.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/MattSherry.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8176\" width=\"296\" height=\"254\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/MattSherry.jpg 629w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/MattSherry-300x258.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 296px) 100vw, 296px\" \/><\/a><figcaption>Full-time RV&#8217;ers Sherry and Matt<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p>Well, since we were passing through the area (always looking for places to go and things to see), we took a few hours while we were staying at Cheyenne Wyoming and drove to Laramie to visit the prison.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The prison was built in 1872 and for 30 years it held a lot of violent and notorious outlaws including Butch Cassidy.  It originally sat on 640 acres and the main building is over 18,000 square feet.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The prison is one of only three federally constructed territorial penitentiaries that still exist and the only one that has most of it&#8217;s original structure still intact.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The rooms that have been restored and are open for viewing include; the intake processing room, Warden&#8217;s office, the kitchen, north cellblock, dining hall, guards quarters, watchtower, infirmary, women&#8217;s cellblock, the prison bathroom, and the laundry.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The Prison Industries Building (also known as the Broom Factory) was built in 1892 by convict labor and holds the original broom making equipment that the convicts used to make the brooms that were sold all over the United States as well as being shipped overseas.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_134259178.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_134259178.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8104\" class=\"wp-image-8104\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_134259178.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_134259178-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_134259178-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The rear opening into the stockade<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133836070.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133836070.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8105\" class=\"wp-image-8105\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133836070.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133836070-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133836070-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">1st &amp; 2nd floor cellblocks<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133623415.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133623415.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8106\" class=\"wp-image-8106\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133623415.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133623415-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133623415-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The prison infirmary<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133248720.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133248720.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8107\" class=\"wp-image-8107\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133248720.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133248720-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133248720-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">On-site guards quarters<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_131555305.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"405\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_131555305.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8109\" class=\"wp-image-8109\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_131555305.jpg 405w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_131555305-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 405px) 100vw, 405px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">More cells in the other wing<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_131424573.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_131424573.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8110\" class=\"wp-image-8110\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_131424573.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_131424573-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_131424573-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">A typical 2 man cell (concrete)<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133151453.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133151453.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8108\" class=\"wp-image-8108\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133151453.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133151453-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_133151453-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The mess hall<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_134431620.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_134431620.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8103\" class=\"wp-image-8103\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_134431620.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_134431620-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_134431620-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The broom factory<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_134549738.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_134549738.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8102\" class=\"wp-image-8102\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_134549738.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_134549738-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_134549738-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Finished brooms for sale<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_130742780.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_130742780.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8111\" class=\"wp-image-8111\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_130742780.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_130742780-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211006_130742780-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The front of the prison shows the stockade walls surrounding the rear yard<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>We found the venue really interesting to visit and just might like to work there ourselves in the future.  Dressing up in period costumes and &#8220;playing the part&#8221; can be fun!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Thanks again for riding along and we hope to see you here again soon.  In the meantime, be good to and for each other and you&#8217;ll be blessed back ten-fold.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Herb and Kathy<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We&#8217;ve been traveling the country for about five